==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX FireRed & LeafGreen|Drowzee|32}} from the {{TCG|EX FireRed & LeafGreen}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Drowzee}}.
*'''Mumble''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Great Encounters|Whismur|94}} from the {{TCG|Great Encounters}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

